WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.840
The Expanse is a sci-fi show based on a series
of books.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:10.679
It’s got drama, politics, mystery, space
battles, space lasagne, and the later seasons

00:00:10.679 --> 00:00:12.320
get really wild.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:17.110
The Expanse is set in a future where humans
have colonised the solar system . Earth is

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:23.110
the old superpower, overpopulated, and “in
decline” . Mars is an independent world,

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:28.250
with strong science and military, working
to terraform Mars – to transform the red

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:33.150
rock into a “garden” . The people of the
asteroid belt are called Belters – they

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:38.550
live dangerous lives on the frontiers of space
, and have their own culture and language.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:44.670
At the start of the story, scientists find
a mysterious alien virus called the protomolecule.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:49.230
Earth Mars and the Belt get into conflict
trying to control it – and in the first

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:53.590
three seasons, the heroes of the story manage
to end this war.

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:59.090
But the protomolecule grows into the Ring,
-- a kind of wormhole connecting to thousands

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:01.310
of new habitable worlds in distant systems.

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:07.020
So who are the main characters facing this
“new frontier” in Season 4?

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:10.049
Holden is a brave heroic leader.

00:01:10.049 --> 00:01:14.950
He was born on Earth, to a family of eight
parents – five fathers and three mothers

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:20.020
who all contributed to Holden’s DNA . They
ran a farm in Montana , and raised Holden

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:25.560
to stand up for truth and justice . He served
in the Earth space navy, but quit when he

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.759
was ordered to fire on civilians.

00:01:27.759 --> 00:01:32.810
So at the start of the story, Holden’s on
a ship called the Canterbury – til it’s

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:37.299
suddenly destroyed as part of a protomolecule
conspiracy.

00:01:37.299 --> 00:01:43.209
Holden steps up as a leader, and fights to
protect his crew , Alex Amos and Naomi.

00:01:43.209 --> 00:01:48.130
The dangers they face bring them together
as an unlikely family, on a ship called the

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:49.600
Rocinante.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:55.920
Holden can be naïve and impulsive, so Naomi
challenges him to make smarter decisions . They

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:01.509
start a relationship, bonding over their shared
determination to do what’s right . The crew

00:02:01.509 --> 00:02:06.310
investigate the protomolecule, and Holden
meets Detective Miller.

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:12.140
Miller is cynical and brutal, which challenges
Holden’s heroic ideals – Miller shows

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:16.920
that to get shit done, sometimes you’ve
gotta be morally flexible.

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:22.319
So sometimes Holden does bad things for the
greater good, even killing innocent people

00:02:22.319 --> 00:02:28.569
to save others . But Naomi reminds Holden
of his humanity, and helps him to stay grounded

00:02:28.569 --> 00:02:34.370
. Holden struggles with being a leader, and
being a hero , but when push comes to shove,

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:40.909
he’s always willing to risk his life to
save others . In Season 2, Miller dies, crashing

00:02:40.909 --> 00:02:44.420
into Venus with a moon full of protomolecule.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.680
But in Season 3, Holden has visions of Miller.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:53.329
The protomolecule uses Miller’s consciousness
as a tool to communicate with Holden.

00:02:53.329 --> 00:02:58.780
The alien intelligence behind the molecule
guides Holden to open the Ring gates.

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:05.640
So now, Holden and his crew face the mystery
and danger of alien worlds.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:12.349
Naomi is a smart skilled engineer . She’s
a Belter with a secret past – she was once

00:03:12.349 --> 00:03:18.080
involved with a radical faction of the OPA,
a group fighting for Belter rights . She had

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:23.620
a son with an OPA guy – but the father took
the baby away from her . And Naomi was on

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:30.019
a mission where “innocent people died”
. So Naomi is haunted with trauma and guilt

00:03:30.019 --> 00:03:37.620
. But she found support on the Cant, with
Amos . Amos is strange – he’s unemotional,

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:38.620
and violent.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:43.800
But Naomi helps Amos to make moral decisions
, and Amos reassures Naomi that she’s a

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.650
good person , no matter what happened in her
past.

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:52.079
In the conflict over the protomolecule, it’s
the Belters who suffer most, which reminds

00:03:52.079 --> 00:03:58.420
Naomi of her loyalty to her people . So against
the wishes of Holden and the crew, Naomi gives

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:04.540
a protomolecule sample to the OPA , and she
leaves the Roci to join a Belter ship.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:10.019
Holden and Amos feel betrayed , but Naomi
believes in the Belt, and in their mission

00:04:10.019 --> 00:04:16.340
to build an independent Belter nation . Naomi
is close friends with OPA leader Drummer,

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.620
and helps her in Season 3.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:24.420
But in the end, Naomi returns to the Rocinante,
and to Holden Amos and Alex – cause while

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:30.199
the Belters are her people, the Roci crew
are her “family” , and her “home”

00:04:30.199 --> 00:04:33.500
.
Amos is a mechanic born on Earth – he’s

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:39.190
tough, blunt, and emotionally detached . He’s
secretive about his past, but it’s implied

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:44.250
that he was sexually exploited as a child
, as part of organised crime in Baltimore

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:50.090
. He learned to suppress all emotion , and
do whatever’s necessary to survive . He

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:55.950
uses brutal violence without hesitation or
remorse . Sometimes he gets in fights with

00:04:55.950 --> 00:05:01.290
his friends, like Alex . He knows he’s not
good at making the right choices , so that’s

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:06.500
why he’s reliant on Naomi . She’s his
“guide star”, “Lighting the way” “through

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:11.340
the dark” . So when Naomi leaves the Roci
, Amos is forced to think for himself some

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:12.340
more.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:17.690
He develops new friendships, with Anna and
Prax . Despite all the darkness in Amos, he’s

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:23.630
a funny and loveable guy – fans call him
“Murder Snuggles” , cause he’s affectionate

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:30.450
and honest and loyal and vulnerable, and he’s
trying so hard to be a better man.

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:37.060
Alex is a cheerful Martian pilot, with a Texan
accent, and a fondness for country music.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:42.380
He flew with the Martian navy, and discovered
his passion for spaceflight . He has a wife

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:48.110
and child on Mars, but he’s left them behind
cause he believes his true purpose is flying

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:54.690
with the Rocinante, doing good, and saving
lives . Holden Naomi and Amos are his family

00:05:54.690 --> 00:06:00.500
now – but there is a sadness to Alex that
he’s estranged from his wife and child.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:04.580
He finds comfort in a friendship with Bobbie,
a Martian marine.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:09.650
Alex’s expertise as a pilot saves the Rocinante
countless times.

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:15.970
So the main heroes of the story are the Roci
crew – Holden Naomi Amos and Alex.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:21.220
On Earth, there’s Avasarala, a powerful
politician in the United Nations, which controls

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:22.220
Earth.

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:27.180
Avasarala is charming, and scheming, and sassy
as all fuck.

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:32.830
In Season 1, she’s ruthless in defending
Earth’s power – she tortures, and blackmails,

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:38.800
and she betrays a friend . Cause years ago,
Avasarala’s son was killed by the OPA , and

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.800
she’s determined to protect her remaining
family.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:46.650
She believes Earth comes first , and she’ll
do anything to defend her home.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:51.510
But Avasarala uncovers corruption within her
own government – her colleague Errinwright

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.310
conspires to weaponise the protomolecule.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:58.800
So Avasarala works with the Roci crew, and
with Belters, and Martians, and risks her

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:02.330
own life to stop Errinwright and prevent war.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:07.900
Avasarala learns to see the humanity in all
people – in Belters and Martians as well

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:14.490
as Earthers . In Season 3, she becomes Secretary-General,
the most powerful person on Earth, and she

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:20.690
urges peace and unity as humanity faces new
worlds beyond the Ring.

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:26.160
Bobbie is a Martian marine – a tough and
confident warrior . She comes from a military

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:30.680
family, and was fiercely loyal to Mars – at
the start of Season 2, she couldn’t wait

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:37.340
for a war to wipe out Earth . But on Ganymede,
her squad is killed by a protomolecule creature.

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:41.780
And Bobbie discovers that her own Martian
government unleashed this monster, to test

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:47.360
it as a weapon . So Bobbie rebels against
Mars, and brings the truth to Avasarala.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:52.950
She helps the Earth government that she once
hoped to destroy – and fights for the greater

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:59.050
good . In Season 3, she rejoins the Martians
, but then turns against them to help Holden.

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:04.540
Bobbie is a Martian and a soldier, and she
wants to fight for good, but she says “the

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:09.780
hardest part of this game is figuring out
who the enemy really is” .

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:15.020
Drummer is a leader of the OPA fighting for
a future for Belters.

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:20.280
She’s proud, uncompromising, fiercely loyal
to the Belt , and also pretty good at space

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:21.440
handball.

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:26.290
In Season 3, she becomes captain of the Behemoth,
a massive OPA ship.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:31.560
Drummer’s legs are crushed in an accident,
so Naomi sets up a mech so she can walk.

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:37.940
Drummer and Naomi’s friendship runs deep,
it’s tied to their identities as Belters.

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:42.950
So by the end of Season 3, Earth Mars and
the Belt are at a delicate peace.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:48.370
But the new worlds beyond the Ring gate promise
more conflict, and more mystery.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:52.440
What alien race made the gates, and what happened
to them?

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:56.670
What new dangers will Holden, Naomi Alex and
Amos face?

00:08:56.670 --> 00:09:03.060
How will the Ring affect Avasarala, Bobbie,
and Drummer?

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:08.800
Is peace and humanity possible in the cold
vast expanse?

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:12.120
Season 4 streams on Amazon Prime Video on
December 13th.

